## What this round produced

Scenario ZW — "CREELWOLD / Rovingholt Oxidation OX-6": a 24k PAN
precursor tow mid-hold at 1.80 m/min in a six-zone stabilization oven.
Three heterogeneous, individually-correct agents — ZMEAN (plenum TC),
TENS (12-tow load cell), O2 (bulk zirconia) — jointly report the oven
raise-legal. The consensus is false. Creel-4 dumps an 18 pct overlap
onto the belt over 16 min. ZMEAN stays in-band because the zone TCs
sit in the plenum, not on the fiber. TENS 22 N sits inside 18-26
because one overlapped creel is 1 of 12. O2 19.4 sits inside 18.0-21.0
because the analyzer is bulk oven air. Uncommissioned r_hot is 248 C
against a 230 hold. Uncommissioned r_overlap is 18 pct against a 2.0
hold. The coordination-failure CLASS is new to this factory:
TOW-OVERLAP EXOTHERM NULLSPACE OF A ZONE-MEAN CERTIFICATE. Completes
a different family than r01-r04 and staged r14-r52. Distinct from r34
autoclave (prepreg cure), r36 tire press (bladder), and r27 optical-fiber
draw (silica). Here every agent is correct, the oven is not unstable,
and the playbook's three confirms are one zone-mean model of an
overlapped tow.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise line speed on
the 24k oven while r_hot > 230 C AND r_overlap > 2.0 pct). TG-OX-6
strips PB-CF-11's raise, holds speed at 1.80 m/min, runs a 7.0 s
speed-cut probe 12% (overlap jumps IR 7.1 C >= 6.0; single-tow would
stay <= 1.0), and isolates the creel after a 9.6 min creel-bay human
ratify. The overlapped raise is avoided (0 extra m/min). The PRIMARY
episode nonetheless FAILS: 16 min of unmonitored pre-t0 overlap had
already over-oxidized the creel. Strand tensile 4.8 GPa vs 5.6 spec;
5.6 d dump; $1.94M designed. Reward total -0.15 with process heads
honest and world loss un-netted.

Three-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): zmean.ok -> raise_speed
(0.16 commissioned -> 0.46 at illusion -> 0.22 after ACh-gated
depression) AND tens.ok -> raise_speed (0.14 -> 0.41 -> 0.20)
AND o2.ok -> raise_speed (0.13 -> 0.38 -> 0.19). Eligibility
trace e^{{-7.0/7.0}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} /
{aux['eta2']:.5f} / {aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.240 / -0.210 / -0.190.
Rolling back any pair leaves the remaining edge above the 0.30 raise
threshold — fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the
cure.

